* pt_rfdriver: generated by analog/rf_tx/circuits.py
* Two resistively loaded pre-amplifiers, NMOS source followers and a differential output pair with four binary
* switched tail slices (g3..g0 = rfdriver.gain code[7:4]); ~20 ohm/leg source resistors behind
* a PMOS header. bypass=1 turns the header and all tails off and connects in_* to pad_* through
* PMOS switches (debug.rf_tx_bypass, external-PA fallback).
.subckt pt_rfdriver VDD VSS in_p in_n pad_p pad_n ibias en mute bypass g0 g1 g2 g3 se atb_bias atb_pre atb_cm
